                "raw_text": "Twin Drive. (Whenever a follower with Twin Drive attacks, it performs 2 drive checks.)\nOn Evolve - Look at the top 3 cards of your deck. You may put a Kagero follower not named Dragon Knight, Aleph from among them into your EX area. It costs 3 less to play this turn. Put the rest on the bottom of your deck in any order.",
